  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ebe9b5ff9b93e809",
      "translationZh": "供参考，引擎的默认内核规则是在较小的芯片（16/20 核的 M5 和 32 核的 M4 Max）上测定的，因此在 40 核的 M5 Max 上运行时，用的是推测出来的配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "505ac6b210bbc164",
      "translationZh": "Splash 的仓库包含一个开发者工具“make tune-kernels”，它会在你的硬件上测试每个量化矩阵乘法的所有可用运行方式。在我的机器上，它发现，对于检查草稿 token 的 8 行步骤，“split-K”布局（将每个输入行拆成四份，最后再合并部分和）要快得多。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df666b1f57c5c9d0",
      "translationZh": "为 Inco 写了相关说明（ https://github.com/incoai/splash/issues/154 ）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b9913b16b03421a",
      "translationZh": "从源码构建 Splash（git clone https://github.com/incoai/splash , git checkout 1.0.2, make；需要 Xcode 26+ 及 Metal 工具链），然后在空闲的 Mac 上运行 build/engine-tests/tune-kernels build/splash.metallib <your model folder> --confirm。--confirm 这一步会告诉你，胜出的配置是否真的能在你的芯片上加速整个前向计算过程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89d74e8dd243fc51",
      "translationZh": "使用你选择的模型进行替换。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff90fddd42d1c21f",
      "translationZh": "Swift Model 的转换版本也可在 hugging face 上获取，地址为：https://huggingface.co/SiliconSpecies/Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27B-Splash",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
